# WireGuard Installer for macOS (Apple Silicon)

A lightweight and automated installer for setting up **WireGuard tools** on macOS systems (optimized for Apple Silicon M-series chips such as M1/M2/M3/M4).

This script automates dependency installation, system validation, and WireGuard setup using Homebrew.

---

## 🚀 Features

- ✔ Automatic system architecture detection
- ✔ Homebrew installation (if missing)
- ✔ WireGuard tools installation via Homebrew
- ✔ Installation verification (`wg`, `wg-quick`)
- ✔ Clean logging with colored output
- ✔ macOS Apple Silicon optimization

---

## 📦 Installation

You can install and run the script directly from this GitHub repository:

```bash
curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/<username>/<repo>/main/install.sh | bash

